{"id":"d67f64f2aefcc752","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-demand.md","title":"Demand Function","display":"df-demand — Demand Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-demand","aliases":["58-df-demand","Demand Function"],"display":"df-demand — Demand Function","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-utility.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-budget-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-demand"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-demand</span><span>Demand Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-demand — Demand Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0597127ba0cc6437\" href=\"?note=0597127ba0cc6437\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-utility.md\">../batch11/58-df-utility.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e825d53bd327fe88\" href=\"?note=e825d53bd327fe88\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-budget-set.md\">../batch17/58-df-budget-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in V\">\\(D\\in V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf p\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}^n\">\\(\\mathbf p\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}^n\\)</span> (需求集、商品数与价格向量)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span> (收入)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(u:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> (效用函数, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0597127ba0cc6437\" href=\"?note=0597127ba0cc6437\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-utility.md\">../batch11/58-df-utility.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(\\mathbf p,m)=\\{\\mathbf x\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n:\\mathbf p\\cdot\\mathbf x\\leq m\\}\">\\(B(\\mathbf p,m)=\\{\\mathbf x\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n:\\mathbf p\\cdot\\mathbf x\\leq m\\}\\)</span> (预算集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e825d53bd327fe88\" href=\"?note=e825d53bd327fe88\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-budget-set.md\">../batch17/58-df-budget-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Demand}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Demand}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（本文件定义的显式维数 Marshall 需求关系）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_u\">\\(D_u\\)</span> (Marshall 需求对应的兼容集合记号)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}demand} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Demand}_S(D,u,\\mathbf p,m,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\\mathbf p\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}^n\n\\land m\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land u:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n\\to\\mathbb R\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land B(\\mathbf p,m)=\\{\\mathbf x\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n:\\mathbf p\\cdot\\mathbf x\\leq m\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land D=\\{\\mathbf x\\in B(\\mathbf p,m):\n\\forall\\mathbf y\\in B(\\mathbf p,m)\\;(u(\\mathbf y)\\leq u(\\mathbf x))\\}\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}demand} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Demand}_S(D,u,\\mathbf p,m,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\\mathbf p\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}^n\n\\land m\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land u:\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n\\to\\mathbb R\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land B(\\mathbf p,m)=\\{\\mathbf x\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n:\\mathbf p\\cdot\\mathbf x\\leq m\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land D=\\{\\mathbf x\\in B(\\mathbf p,m):\n\\forall\\mathbf y\\in B(\\mathbf p,m)\\;(u(\\mathbf y)\\leq u(\\mathbf x))\\}\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}demand\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\nD_u(\\mathbf p,m)=D\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Demand}_S(D,u,\\mathbf p,m,n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}demand\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\nD_u(\\mathbf p,m)=D\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Demand}_S(D,u,\\mathbf p,m,n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Marshallian demand is set-valued unless existence and uniqueness of a maximizer have been proved.</li>\n<li>Hicksian demand: minimizes expenditure to achieve utility level; depends on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbf{p}, \\bar{u})\">\\((\\mathbf{p}, \\bar{u})\\)</span></li>\n<li>当最大化解唯一时，Marshall 需求函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf x^*(\\mathbf p,m)\">\\(\\mathbf x^*(\\mathbf p,m)\\)</span> 是对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_u(\\mathbf p,m)\">\\(D_u(\\mathbf p,m)\\)</span> 的唯一元素。</li>\n<li>Slutsky 方程需要可微性、内点解等额外假设，应作为独立定理；原文件的二阶效用导数等式并非一般的 Slutsky 对称性。</li>\n<li>Walras' law: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{p} \\cdot \\mathbf{z}(\\mathbf{p}, m) = 0\">\\(\\mathbf{p} \\cdot \\mathbf{z}(\\mathbf{p}, m) = 0\\)</span> where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{z}\">\\(\\mathbf{z}\\)</span> is excess demand</li>\n<li>Aggregate demand: sum of individual demands; satisfies excess demand properties</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mas-Colell, Whinston and Green, Microeconomic Theory</li>\n<li>Varian, Microeconomic Analysis</li>\n<li>Debreu, Theory of Value</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links"